      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait really?? a blood clot sounds super scary. i dont know if i can make it to the er right now tho, im like way out in the suburbs and it's late. do u think it could just be muscle strain from the cramped seat? i was sitting in one position for like 10 hours straight. it feels more like a dull ache when i move a certain way.",
